        ||        ||        ||        ||        ||        ||
        ||        ||        ||        ||        ||        ||
     ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
        the road runs between the stacks and does not turn

                          o
                         /|\
                         / \      and there are prints
                                  and they are not yours

     ____________________________________________________
      whatever walks this road is bigger than the road
---
The last stretch: a road between cooling stacks, running in.
The prints in the dust are deep and very far apart.
